{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"workshop_t3","model_identifier":"workshop_t3","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# workshop_t3\n\nGreat Workshop (tier 3): two storeys, stone below and timber above, a crane arm swinging out from the loft door and a big lathe wheel by the yard.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 8 columns (160 x 128 units, 4.50 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -102..54, y 0..191, z -66..56 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 134, construction_0 25, construction_33 69, construction_66 86, ruined 27 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- workshop: 112 x 194 x 76 centred at x -8, z 14\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `workshop_t3_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `workshop_t3_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_workshop_t3` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 6.0 | loop | `crane` arm swings out and back. `lathe_wheel` turns once per 1.6 s. The lathe flywheel turns. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-36, 0, -33)\n- `slot_work` at (-80, 0, -66)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-36, 0, -36)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"ws_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-66.0,0.0,-26.0],"to":[50.0,3.0,54.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,351.0,116.0,354.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[344.0,351.0,424.0,354.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,351.0,116.0,354.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[344.0,351.0,424.0,354.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[255.0,0.0,371.0,80.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[255.0,0.0,371.0,80.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2164aa28-4642-5624-b57c-39ef7ca23964"},{"name":"ws_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-64.0,3.0,-24.0],"to":[48.0,87.0,-20.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,138.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[206.0,0.0,210.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,138.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[206.0,0.0,210.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[38.0,338.0,150.0,342.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[38.0,338.0,150.0,342.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b7e40520-066f-52b5-b0f9-4cf499759cf6"},{"name":"ws_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-64.0,3.0,48.0],"to":[48.0,87.0,52.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,138.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[210.0,0.0,214.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,138.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[210.0,0.0,214.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[150.0,338